@@ -24,6 +24,8 @@
 
 <a id="use-this-package"></a>
 ## Use this package
+
+Local deployments may cap pressure headroom and summary output through the synchronous `compaction/token-budget` waterfall. Each operation supplies its Agent; absent listeners preserve preset defaults, caps cannot increase preset values, and invalid integers fail before use. Unloading a listener restores the resolved preset policy.
 
 Mount this package to get automatic conversation condensation in a composition that already provides an LLM, session storage, and token measurement. The shipped `dsh` base enables it by default; mount it explicitly to control when condensation starts.
 
